sel slides. Email must include a subject line and complete body. Do not merely summarize: adapt the source into useful channel-native copy while preserving every factual boundary. The case study must clearly distinguish source facts from proposed marketing framing. Social posts must contain no unsupported claims. Append the compliance disclaimer only when the source concerns tax, legal, finance, or a client case; do not force a tax disclaimer onto unrelated technology content.' }] }, { role: 'user', content: [{ type: 'input_text', text: `Content ID: ${$json.contentId}
